# The library states its ABI version before any other call, so a binding
# can refuse a different major (SPEC.md §13, C ABI boundary). The patch
# is not pinned: the suite's minimum (FORMAT.md, Versions) bounds it, and
# a library of a later 0.1.z runs the same scenarios.
format 1
id abi.version
abi 0.1
covers "abi version"

call karyos_abi_version
expect KARYOS_OK major=0 minor=1
